### 2. Update Runtime (`apps/game-runtime/src/runtime/GameRuntimeServer.ts`)

Emit the metrics whenever the session state is sent (which happens on connection, phase change, and tick). We will also ensure the metrics are sent immediately after a turn completes or an action is processed to keep the HUD fresh.

